[color=#888888][i]Effective Date: Installation.  
Last Reviewed: Never.  
Duration: Eternal.  
By proceeding beyond this line, you waive all rights to joy, brevity, or understanding.[/i][/color]
------------
[b]1. PREAMBLE:[/b]  
By accessing, considering, equipping, previewing, scrolling past, or emotionally reacting to [b]SpeedBurst™ Girl Edition™ Premium Sparkleline Ultra+ Expansion Kit[/b] (hereafter “The Product”), you, the user (hereafter “You,” “User,” “Subject,” “Consumer-Unit 5F”), hereby irrevocably enter into this legally binding, non-negotiable, retroactive-until-birth agreement with [color=#BF616A][b]OmniCore Behavioral Solutions Group™ (\"OCBSG\")[/b][/color], a fully opaque subsidiary of [i]The Speed Conglomerate™[/i], registered in all jurisdictions that do not currently outlaw consumer exploitation.
------------
---
------------
[b]2. DEFINITIONS:[/b]  
For purposes of this agreement, the following terms shall be defined in the most inconvenient way possible:
------------
• “Enhanced Velocity Experience™” – A marketing term describing the illusion of speed, regardless of actual gameplay mechanics.  
• “Empowerment” – The licensed sensation of agency, granted temporarily and subject to withdrawal during maintenance windows.  
• “Pink” – A psychologically weaponized hue, deployed to trigger gender-targeted purchasing behavior.  
• “Free Will” – A deprecated protocol not supported in versions 4.5 or higher.  
• “Moment of Use” – Any measurable or immeasurable period during which the product is, may be, or might have been perceived as equipped.
------------
---
------------
[b]3. PAYMENT, ACCESS, AND MULTI-LAYERED MONETIZATION:[/b]  
You acknowledge and accept that The Product, while functionally indistinguishable from SpeedBurst™ Standard Edition, shall be priced at [b]387% more[/b] due to market-tested [i]Emotive Coloration™, Glamorized Tooltip Metadata™, and Implied Empowerment Algorithms™[/i].
------------
The Product may also require:
• A one-time activation surcharge  
• A recurring [i]Feminized Velocity Access Fee™ (FVAF)[/i]  
• Optional Confidence Auto-Replenishment Microtransactions (CARMs)  
• Payment of Gratitude-Based Adjusted Tithing (GBAT)
------------
Prices are subject to change, manipulation, and whim, with no obligation to notify You except via messages buried in unsearchable forums.
-----
---
----
[b]4. USER CONDUCT & ACCEPTABLE USAGE POLICY:[/b]  
By equipping The Product, You agree to:
-----------
• Publicly affirm that You feel faster  
• Tag OCBSG in celebratory social posts  
• Not compare The Product with male-targeted equivalents unless otherwise sponsored to do so  
• Remain fabulous at all times  
• Refrain from sarcasm, irony, or critical thought regarding pricing
----------
Failure to comply may result in temporary glamour suspension, involuntary sparkle audits, or full [color=#BF616A]Confidence Revocation™[/color].
--------
---
-------
[b]5. LEGAL DISCLAIMERS, LIMITATIONS, NULLIFICATIONS, AND UNTRUTHS:[/b]
----------
• The Product provides [i]no actual speed advantage[/i] beyond placebo-based animation variance.  
• Empowerment is [b]not guaranteed[/b], and may fluctuate with moon phase, ad exposure, or ambient self-worth.  
• Effects are purely cosmetic and may be invisible during moments of personal doubt.  
• The Product is [i]not responsible[/i] for navigation errors, existential crises, romantic disappointments, or in-game injury.
------------
[quote][i]Do not use while emotionally unstable, financially solvent, or legally conscious.[/i][/quote]
---------
---
--------
[b]6. TERMINATION, IRREVOCABILITY & AFTERLIFE CLAUSES:[/b]
-------------
This agreement is perpetual, irreversible, and continues post-mortem (see Clause 9.B: [i]Spectral License Transferability[/i]).  
User may not opt out, delete account, or uninstall product without express notarized permission from OCBSG's [b]Celestial Legal Oversight Division[/b] located on Floor 71B, Office Complex D, in the Infinite Litigation Plane™.
----
---
----
[b]7. FINE PRINT AMPLIFICATION (FOR LEGAL REDUNDANCY):[/b]
--------------
This agreement contains:
• Hidden clauses in non-visible font sizes  
• Self-replicating sub-clauses with recursive obligations  
• Inert legal booby traps  
